WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.375 --> 00:00:03.141
Unit thirteen. Hygiene Habits!

2
00:00:04.107 --> 00:00:07.822
Hello, everyone! I'm Nurse Bopha, your school nurse.

3
00:00:07.872 --> 00:00:11.435
Hi, Nurse Bopha! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:11.485 --> 00:00:15.233
Today we learn about Hygiene Habits. Let's go!

5
00:00:16.215 --> 00:00:19.948
Hygiene. Say it with me. Hygiene!

6
00:00:23.438 --> 00:00:27.371
Handwashing. Say it with me. Handwashing!

7
00:00:30.896 --> 00:00:34.129
Shower. Say it with me. Shower!

8
00:00:37.623 --> 00:00:40.873
Teeth. Say it with me. Teeth!

9
00:00:44.373 --> 00:00:47.756
Clothes. Say it with me. Clothes!

10
00:00:51.263 --> 00:00:54.863
Nails. Say it with me. Nails!

11
00:00:58.363 --> 00:01:01.946
Germs. Say it with me. Germs!

12
00:01:05.449 --> 00:01:09.049
Routine. Say it with me. Routine!

13
00:01:12.536 --> 00:01:20.758
Good hygiene protects me from germs. My routine includes handwashing, a daily shower, brushing my teeth, wearing clean clothes, and trimming my nails.

14
00:01:20.808 --> 00:01:21.978
I can do that too!

15
00:01:23.337 --> 00:01:28.491
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:28.541 --> 00:01:29.691
Shower!

17
00:01:30.537 --> 00:01:35.989
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:36.038 --> 00:01:37.189
Germs!

19
00:01:37.961 --> 00:01:43.370
Did you know? Handwashing is most important before eating and after using the toilet!

20
00:01:43.420 --> 00:01:45.288
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:01:46.058 --> 00:01:54.275
Think and answer. Which hygiene habit is hardest for you to remember?

22
00:01:54.325 --> 00:01:55.475
Great answer!

23
00:01:56.785 --> 00:02:01.585
Great job today! Stay healthy, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:02:01.635 --> 00:02:04.326
Goodbye, everyone! Stay healthy!

